text.轮海为圣体内修炼秘境，突破秘境可提升自身实力\\n轮海有四小秘境，分别对应提升：:
Ocean is the secret realm inside a saint's body.Make breakthrough to improve your power.
There are 4 Mini-realms in the Ocean, increasing corresponding stats：Ocean of Ardent - Qi, Vital Fountain - Strength, Rainbow Bridge - Health and Nirvana - Agility;
Making breakthrough costs Taoist Minds, which can be collected by upgrading character Realm （only at Skywalker or above）
The development is based on your choice;
Level upgrades and Taoist Minds distributed can be reset for free.

text.洞府-<color=#9e4444>前期资源核心产出系统</color>\\n\:
Adobe: <color=#9e4444>Place to earn in-game resources in the early stage</color>

1、Tap <color=#9e4444>Event</color> on the home page to get starting funds, <color=#9e4444>make sure you have claimed it</color>;
2、<color=#9e4444>Gems</color>, <color=#9e4444>Wood</color> and <color=#9e4444>Iron</color> need to be used in <color=#9e4444>Bag</color>;
3、<color=#9e4444>In internal affairs</color>, upgrade <color=#9e4444>Food</color> first.（<color=#9e4444>Servants cost food to work</color>）;
4、Output order when you have <color=#9e4444>enough food</color>: <color=#9e4444>Wood > Iron > Gem</color>.

text.悟道-<color=#9e4444>挂机增长丹道、器道、角色修为</color>:
Enlightenment：<color=#9e4444>Automated gameplay with Alchemist, Blacksmith and Character boosts</color> 

1、<color=#0c5a8b>Level required</color>：reach <color=#9e4444>required level</color> to use corresponding Taoist Books;
2、<color=#0c5a8b>How to get Taoist Books</color>：trade at <color=#9e4444>Shop and Div.Jade Tower</color>;
3、<color=#0c5a8b>Rewards</color>：massive XP <color=#9e4444>for the first Enlightenment attempt</color>.

text.炼丹-丹药炼制是<color=#9e4444>快速提升</color>角色属性的:
Alchemist is an important means to <color=#9e4444>quickly improve</color> character attributes.

<color=#0c5a8b>Item refining</color>：
1） Gear refining can <color=#9e4444>improve gear attributes</color>;
2） Transform can <color=#9e4444>greatly improve the gear</color>;
3） The refined void gem can <color=#9e4444>expand the backpack capacity</color>.

<color=#0c5a8b>Alchemist and Blacksmith Upgrades</color>：
1） You can upgrade them at <color=#9e4444>Adobe</color>;
2） <color=#9e4444>Mystery Shop/Jade Tower</color> Purchase the XP of using alchemy/refining tools to quickly improve;
3） After successfully done alchemy and weapon refining, there is a probability of increasing XP in alchemy and weaponry.

<color=#0c5a8b>Get Cauldron and Tripod</color>：
1） Purchase at <color=#9e4444>Market</color> at level 1~2;
2） Grade <color=#9e4444>3~9</color> recipes need to be redeemed from <color=#9e4444>Guild - Treasure</color>;
3） Grade <color=#9e4444>10~20 Cauldrons and Tripods</color> blueprints can be found from <color=#9e4444>Guild - Treasure - Secret Treasure</color>.The blueprint types vary due to different specializations;
4） Grade <color=#9e4444>21~23 Cauldrons and Tripods</color> blueprints are available for sale at <color=#9e4444>Jade Market</color>.

<color=#0c5a8b>Duration</color>：The higher the level of the Tripod/Cauldron used, the shorter the <color=#9e4444>time required for refining</color>.

<color=#0c5a8b>Guild Bonus</color>：Each Guild focuses on different methods of alchemy and weaponry.After joining, you will receive the corresponding alchemy and weapon <color=#9e4444>XP growth bonus</color>.

text.1、角色、怪物<color=#9e4444>各出手一次</color>，计算为一:
1、A round is set after <color=#9e4444>your character and your enemy strike once</color>;
2、The strike order in each round is based on Agility.<color=#9e4444>Units with higher Agility strike first</color>;
3、The way that certain effects are triggered is based on the situation of the combat.Ethereal Chant for example：
 Effect：Increases your EVA by X% for 6 rounds each time when you evade enemy attack;
 It means that it will take effect in the current round when enemies strike first;
 And when your character strikes first, then it will take effect in the next round.

text.诛仙阵和九州商会<color=#9e4444>轮流开放</color>，时光秘境:
Deity Slain Array and Jiuzhou Commerce Chamber will be <color=#9e4444>opened in turns</color>, and the Time Realm is opened on <color=#9e4444>1st day every month</color>.The Nether Judge will be available from <color=#9e4444>every Tuesday to Sunday</color>.

<color=#0c5a8b>Deity Slain Array</color>
1、Place assisting Techniques on the <color=#9e4444>first 2 slots</color> and offensive ones on the remaining slots.
2、Then break the 4 Side-tactits of Kill, Slay, Trap and Strike, in order to <color=#9e4444>reduce the stats of Sky Bishop</color>;
3、When in the Killing Way, to prevent from defeating the Boss whithout getting all the chests, you could firstly take all the chest and then fight with the Boss;

<color=#0c5a8b>Slaying Way tips</color>：
1、When in the Slaying Way, it is suggested to take the golden chests both in the top left corner and in the bottom left corner which is easier that you need only to defeat 10 beasts or so.Then you could try get as much as the silver chests you can or just get out;
2、The exit of <color=#9e4444>Trapping Way</color> is in the top right corner.If you only ask for passing the level, the shortest route is the way along the bottom of the map;
3、When in the <color=#9e4444>Striking Way</color>, take the entrance as column 1, the 3rd, 6th, 10th and 15th column counted from the left have the Array Eyes which could be activated.

<color=#0c5a8b>Jiuzhou Commerce Chamber</color>：
<color=#9e4444>Simulated Merchant Gameplay</color>, the <color=#9e4444>Jiuzhou Orders</color> obtained in the event can be traded for rare resources such as <color=#9e4444>Jade, G.Heaven Techniques and Quiddity Orbs</color> at the <color=#9e4444>Merchant</color>.

Time Realm
<color=#9e4444>Roguelike event</color> from which you can earn <color=#9e4444>Hourglass</color> that are used to trade for <color=#9e4444>Divine Fire and Transform Gems</color> at the <color=#9e4444>Merchant</color>.

Nether Judge
<color=#9e4444>A text-simulation role-playing feature</color> that awards <color=#9e4444>Fairchild Attainment Orb</color>.

<color=#0c5a8b>Tips</color>：
<color=#0c5a8b>Greater Kindness</color>：saving people or died during the process;
<color=#0c5a8b>Kindness</color>：regret when old, helping others, etc.
<color=#0c5a8b>Sin</color>：minor sins that didn't cause casualty, like laziness, robbery, gambling or escaping from battlefields;
<color=#0c5a8b>Greater Sin</color>：behaviors that caused death.

text.灵兽-<color=#9e4444>提供大量属性加成</color>\\n\\n:
Pets <color=#9e4444>provide massive Stats bonus</color>

1、Each additional Pet increases Mount's stats by <color=#9e4444>10%</color>;
2、Each time you raise a Pet's level by <color=#9e4444>10</color>, your character will gain <color=#9e4444>5%</color> stats boost, which can be useful in the early and middle stages of the game;
3、<color=#9e4444>Seiryu and Sea Demon</color> are recommended in the early stage, while <color=#9e4444>Divine Deer and Tortoise</color> are for the late stages.
Note：Pets provide large stats bonus, and is quite important for <color=#9e4444>ascension</color>.

text.1.您可以点击<color=#9e4444>活动右下方</color>的分享按钮:
1.You can tap the share button at the bottom right of the <color=#9e4444>activity</color> to generate a share screenshot of the game and share it with other players.The picture contains your invite code <color=#9e4444>（other players can use your invite code to redeem rewards）</color>;
2.Every time there is <color=#9e4444>a new player</color> using your invite code to successfully redeem rewards, it will count as your invite <color=#9e4444>once</color>, and you will receive <color=#9e4444>a lottery wheel attempt</color>.The first successful invite will lead to additional rewards;
3.Spin the wheel to unlock the rewards, which will not be repeated.All rewards can be obtained <color=#9e4444>up to 8 spins</color>;
4.The one who was invited <color=#9e4444>must meet the following conditions</color> before they can fill in the invite to redeem rewards （characters under each account can only redeem the reward once）
① The account is created after <color=#9e4444>the activity is opened for the first time</color> （that is, created at 0:00 on March 14, 2023）
② The character level needs to reach <color=#9e4444>Severance G.1</color>, and be lower than <color=#9e4444>Ascension G.10</color>
③ The character needs to belong to a different account from the player who provides the invite code
④ Only one character under the same account can receive the code redemption reward
5.Both parties can be cross-server characters.

text.招式（<color=#9e4444>角色技能</color>），可通过排列组合，:
Skills （<color=#9e4444>character skills</color>）, can be arranged and combined to achieve various types of effects.
\n<color=#0c5a8b>How to arrange</color>：Amplify combat attributes through <color=#9e4444>attribute-enhancing skills</color>, and output through damage skills.（Remember to change your defense moves when you can't resist.）

<color=#0c5a8b>Example</color>：
Slot 1→<color=#0c5a8b>Big Dipper</color>：Increase <color=#9e4444>Defense and Evasion</color> by×% of your Qi for 6 rounds;
 Slot 2→<color=#0c5a8b>4 Phase Skill</color>：Increase <color=#9e4444>Evasion</color> by×% of your Agility, Defense by×% Strength, Attack by×% Qi and max HP by×% Health for 31 rounds;
Slot 3→<color=#0c5a8b>Luoyan Chant</color>：Increase <color=#9e4444>Evasion</color> by×% of your Agility, lasts 5 rounds;
Slot 4→<color=#0c5a8b>Ethereal Chant</color>：each time after dodging the enemy's attack, the next attack temporarily increases <color=#9e4444>Attack by×% of your Evasion</color>, lasts 6 rounds;
Slot 5→<color=#0c5a8b>Firestorm Stifling Chant</color>：Power Factor：X, Damage Bonus：Qi x X
Slot 6→<color=#0c5a8b>Taibai Chant</color>：Power Factor：X, Damage Bonus：True Qi x X, Earth Damage x X

 Slots <color=#9e4444>1,2,3</color> provide <color=#9e4444>Evasion bonus</color> that will be <color=#9e4444>substantially converted to Attack</color> after releasing the Ethereal Chant, which triggers the effect of the stance, <color=#9e4444>adding</color> to the attack stance in slots <color=#9e4444>5, 6</color> to deal a large amount of damage.

Note：You need to <color=#9e4444>adjust the skill type and placement</color> according to the actual situation.If your HP is low, try to change the defense moves, otherwise you can't wait until the 5th or 6th round to strike, you will just <color=#9e4444>get killed</color>.

<color=#0c5a8b>How to get skills</color>：
1、Learn through <color=#9e4444>Sect - Betray</color>, which can be viewed in <color=#9e4444>guild info</color> 
2、<color=#9e4444>After reaching level 31 （Nascence stage）</color>, skills can be exchanged in <color=#9e4444>Celestial Tower</color>;
3、7-day events and limited gift packs;
4、Exchange in the Prestige Tower.

text.1.成功通关镇魔副本后，开启道心魔种系统\\n2.参与<color=#9e444:
1.Demonic Mind unlocks after passing Demon Lock dungeons;
2.Participate in <color=#9e4444>Demonslayer</color> events to upgrade Demons you have and get stats bonus
3.You may upgrade each Demon up to <color=#9e4444>Lv.100</color> and Demons have different bonds between them, which grant bonuses and resources;
4.Socket <color=#9e4444>Demonic Seals</color> to get stats bonuses and you may convert Demonic Seals above Lv.5;
5.You can check stats bonus provided by all Demonic Minds through stats overview;
6.You can buy resources and materials from the Demonic Shop.

text.1、通关后，才可进行扫荡。\\n2、每次扫荡消耗<color=#9e4444>全:
1、Autopass is only available after you pass the level;
2、Each Autopass consumes <color=#9e4444>all stamina</color> for simulated exploration;
3、Before doing Autopass, please make sure you have enough backpack space.
4、The <color=#9e4444>Encounters</color> in the Cloud Nine are special settings and cannot be simulated.

text.1.<color=#9e4444>禁地等级</color>提升的越高，刷新出的禁:
1.<color=#9e4444>When Forbidden Zone is at higher level</color>, you will get harder quests and better rewards;
2.According to their uses, the disciples will be divided into <color=#9e4444>【Squads】</color>;
3.Tap <color=#9e4444>【Team】</color> to select preset teams for Forbidden Zone quests;
4.You can also tap <color=#9e4444>【Decide for Me】</color> button to send vacant disciples to exploration;
5.Tap <color=#9e4444>【Accelerate】</color> to directly complete the current exploration with shortest time remaining;
6.Tap <color=#9e4444>【Progress】</color> to check the status of the exploration quest, after which you can claim all rewards with just one tap.

text.游戏广告分布：\\n1、<color=#9e4444>探索</color>：可进:
In-game ads：
1、<color=#9e4444>Exploration</color>：3 free draws are available;
2、<color=#9e4444>Adobe Acceleration</color>：Increase the speed of adobe resource acquisition;
3、<color=#9e4444>Sign-in</color>：Double the reward;
4、<color=#9e4444>Deity Fortuity and Deity Gift</color>：an important way to get free rewards in the early and middle stages of the game;
5、<color=#9e4444>Dual Cultivation and Black Market</color>：get an extra chance to participate, highly recommended;
6、<color=#9e4444>Cultivation Acceleration, Wander and Ascension Success Rate</color>：Accelerate upgrading and grant quick access to resources;
7、<color=#9e4444>Celestial Tower</color>：provides a large number of Maple Orders, necessary materials for skills and fashions;
8、<color=#9e4444>Paradise - Deity View Platform</color>：watch the daily advertisement to get free resources.
PS：After purchasing 198 Ads Skipper, you can <color=#9e4444>directly claim rewards</color>.

text.法宝受<color=#9e4444>七星阵</color>、<color=#9e:
A Trump can be enhanced twice by <color=#9e4444>Seven Star Array</color> and <color=#9e4444>Zhenpai</color>.

1、When refining a Trump, be sure to put <color=#9e4444>Innerorb</color> into it to get the set attribute bonus;
2、In the early stage, the Innerorbs mainly come from <color=#9e4444>Exploration</color>, and in the later stage, it is mainly produced in <color=#9e4444>Illusory Land</color>.Innerorbs are divided into five attributes: gold, wood, water, fire, and earth.Innerorbs with the same attributes can activate set attributes;
3、The excess main materials can be <color=#9e4444>Dismantled</color> and go to the <color=#9e4444>Essence Shop</color> to exchange for other things;
4、Smelting <color=#9e4444>Trumps with stars</color> or dismantling <color=#9e4444>Artifacts</color> will grant <color=#9e4444>Star Souls</color>, which can be used to upgrade the Artifact

