norm.1.您可以点击<color=#9e4444>活动右下方</color>的分享按钮:
1.You can tap the share button at the bottom right of the <color=#9e4444>activity</color> to generate a share screenshot of the game and share it with other players.The picture contains your invite code <color=#9e4444>（other players can use your invite code to redeem rewards）</color>;
