norm.招式（<color=#9e4444>角色技能</color>），可通过排列组合，:
Skills （<color=#9e4444>character skills</color>）, can be arranged and combined to achieve various types of effects.
\n<color=#0c5a8b>How to arrange</color>：Amplify combat attributes through <color=#9e4444>attribute-enhancing skills</color>, and output through damage skills.（Remember to change your defense moves when you can't resist.）

<color=#0c5a8b>Example</color>：
Slot 1→<color=#0c5a8b>Big Dipper</color>：Increase <color=#9e4444>Defense and Evasion</color> by×% of your Qi for 6 rounds;
 Slot 2→<color=#0c5a8b>4 Phase Skill</color>：Increase <color=#9e4444>Evasion</color> by×% of your Agility, Defense by×% Strength, Attack by×% Qi and max HP by×% Health for 31 rounds;
Slot 3→<color=#0c5a8b>Luoyan Chant</color>：Increase <color=#9e4444>Evasion</color> by×% of your Agility, lasts 5 rounds;
Slot 4→<color=#0c5a8b>Ethereal Chant</color>：each time after dodging the enemy's attack, the next attack temporarily increases <color=#9e4444>Attack by×% of your Evasion</color>, lasts 6 rounds;
Slot 5→<color=#0c5a8b>Firestorm Stifling Chant</color>：Power Factor：X, Damage Bonus：Qi x X
Slot 6→<color=#0c5a8b>Taibai Chant</color>：Power Factor：X, Damage Bonus：True Qi x X, Earth Damage x X

 Slots <color=#9e4444>1,2,3</color> provide <color=#9e4444>Evasion bonus</color> that will be <color=#9e4444>substantially converted to Attack</color> after releasing the Ethereal Chant, which triggers the effect of the stance, <color=#9e4444>adding</color> to the attack stance in slots <color=#9e4444>5, 6</color> to deal a large amount of damage.

Note：You need to <color=#9e4444>adjust the skill type and placement</color> according to the actual situation.If your HP is low, try to change the defense moves, otherwise you can't wait until the 5th or 6th round to strike, you will just <color=#9e4444>get killed</color>.

<color=#0c5a8b>How to get skills</color>：
1、Learn through <color=#9e4444>Sect - Betray</color>, which can be viewed in <color=#9e4444>guild info</color> 
2、<color=#9e4444>After reaching level 31 （Nascence stage）</color>, skills can be exchanged in <color=#9e4444>Celestial Tower</color>;
3、7-day events and limited gift packs;
4、Exchange in the Prestige Tower.

